---
---
<section id="about" class="about section-py" aria-labelledby="about-h2">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">About RJW Renovations</span>
        <h2 id="about-h2">Rhys & Alex.<br />Your Home, Their Standards.</h2>
        <p>
          RJW Renovations was founded in 2018 by Rhys Williams, a time-served tradesman who spent years watching large contractors cut corners and leave homeowners frustrated. He set out to do the opposite — small team, high standards, and work you'd be proud to show off.
        </p>
        <p>
          Alex joined shortly after and the two have worked side by side ever since, covering everything from emergency plumbing call-outs to full kitchen and bathroom renovations across Warwickshire and the wider West Midlands.
        </p>
        <p>
          Their reputation is built on simple things done consistently: arriving when they said they would, quoting what they'll charge, and leaving a finish that lasts. That's why 100% of customers on Which? Trusted Traders say they'd recommend them.
        </p>

        <div class="about-accreditations">
          <a
            href="https://trustedtraders.which.co.uk/businesses/rjw-renovations/"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            target="_blank"
            class="accreditation-badge"
            aria-label="RJW Renovations — Which? Trusted Traders (opens in new tab)"
          >
            <div class="badge-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Which? Trusted Traders</strong>
              <span>Independently accredited since 2020</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="about-ctas">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
          <a href="#reviews" class="btn btn-secondary">Read Our Reviews</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-images" data-reveal data-delay="2" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-img-stack">
          <div class="about-img-main">
            <img
              src="/gallery/kitchen-1.jpg"
              alt="RJW Renovations completed kitchen project"
              width="600"
              height="440"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="about-img-secondary">
            <img
              src="/gallery/bathroom-1.jpg"
              alt="RJW Renovations completed bathroom project"
              width="280"
              height="240"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="about-years-badge" aria-label="6 plus years experience">
            <span class="badge-number">6+</span>
            <span class="badge-text">Years<br />trading</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { background: var(--bg); }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; }
  }

  .about-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .about-text h2 { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .about-text p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }

  .about-accreditations { margin-top: 8px; }
  .accreditation-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-sub);
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }
  .accreditation-badge:hover {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    background: var(--surface-3);
  }
  .badge-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: rgba(61,110,150,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(61,110,150,0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .accreditation-badge strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .accreditation-badge span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .about-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* Image stack */
  .about-images { position: relative; }
  .about-img-stack { position: relative; padding-bottom: 48px; }

  .about-img-main {
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .about-img-main img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 340px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-img-secondary {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 200px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 3px solid var(--bg);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .about-img-secondary img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 150px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-years-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 24px;
    background: var(--red);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(204,34,41,0.4);
  }
  .badge-number {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .badge-text {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
</style>
